            "english": "Please give me that book."
          }
        }
      ],
      "common_pitfall": "Do not confuse 看 (kàn, look) with 看见 (kànjiàn, perceive/see). The result is expressed in the latter.",
      "pronunciation_focus": "In 找不到 (zhǎo bú dào), 不 becomes bú before the fourth-tone 到 (dào).",
